OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Fri 13 Nov to Sun 22 Nov
OL,6,FHigh pressure will initially dominate,
OL,7,Fleading to widely settled conditions
OL,8,Fand overnight frost. A few showers
OL,9,Fwill be possible, particularly in
OL,10,Fnorthern and western Scotland, and
OL,11,Fperhaps along some North Sea coasts
OL,12,Ffor a time. Later in the weekend, a
OL,13,Ftransition to more unsettled
OL,14,Fconditions is expected as bands of
OL,15,Frain, and associated areas of low
OL,16,Fpressure, arrive from the North
OL,17,FAtlantic, bringing more widespread wet
OL,18,Fand windy weather. It is likely to
OL,19,Fremain fairly changeable through the
OL,20,Fremainder of the period, with
OL,21,Foccasional rain interspersed with
OL,22,Fbrighter, showery spells. Whilst
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Fcolder conditions will be possible at
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
OL,24,Ftimes, especially at first, it will
OL,25,Foften be mild, with temperatures near
OL,26,For a little above average for the time
